    "background_story": "Callum, a successful entrepreneur, had always dreamed of owning a luxurious villa in the rolling hills of Tuscany. After years of hard work, he finally made his dream a reality, purchasing a stunning villa overlooking the vineyards. Callum spent his days lounging by the infinity pool, sipping wine, and watching the sunset over the rolling hills. He would often host lavish parties, inviting friends and family to experience the villa's grandeur. But Callum's villa was more than just a status symbol; it was a sanctuary where he could escape the stresses of his busy life. He spent his evenings reading in the villa's library, surrounded by ancient stone walls and the sound of crickets chirping outside. For Callum, the villa was a symbol of his success and a reminder to appreciate the finer things in life.",
